  "totalBlocks": 40,
  "translatedBlocks": 40,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c01a96df1b38978",
      "translationZh": "生成式 AI 和 ChatGPT 等大语言模型的兴起，提升了人们对嵌入模型的关注，也凸显了它们在多种任务中的重要性，尤其是在检索增强生成方面，例如搜索或与你的数据对话。嵌入之所以有用，是因为它们将句子、图像、词语等表示为数值向量，使我们能够映射语义相关的项目并检索有用的信息。这有助于我们为提示提供相关上下文，从而提高生成内容的质量和针对性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a4790ac50960458",
      "translationZh": "与大语言模型相比，嵌入模型的体积更小，推理速度更快。这一点非常重要，因为在更换模型或改进模型微调之后，你需要重新生成嵌入。此外，为了提供良好的用户体验，整个检索增强过程也需要尽可能快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfc5c30131fe73f4",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们将向你展示如何使用 Text Embedding Inference，将开源嵌入模型部署到 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints，这是我们提供的托管式 SaaS 解决方案，可让模型部署变得轻松。此外，我们还将教你如何运行大规模批量请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e68c1fa86cf5e9cc",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba6aa08a5ae832ad",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Text Embedding Inference",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93c1b4310c9a3c6b",
      "translationZh": "将嵌入模型部署为推理端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30dfbbfc1da51800",
      "translationZh": "向端点发送请求并创建嵌入",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fed29fd80f156df",
      "translationZh": "在开始之前，让我们回顾一下有关 Inference Endpoints 的知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "04d71c20bf1d3c4d",
      "translationZh": "1. 什么是 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da54ac586af6a903",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 提供了一种简单、安全的方式，可将机器学习模型部署到生产环境中使用。Inference Endpoints 让开发者和数据科学家无需管理基础设施，即可创建生成式 AI 应用：将部署过程简化为只需点击几下，包括通过自动扩缩容处理大量请求、通过缩容至零降低基础设施成本，以及提供高级安全保障。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac12c3d7b734c61f",
      "translationZh": "以下是一些最重要的功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ab491bbd472923c",
      "translationZh": "轻松部署：只需点击几下，即可将模型部署为可用于生产环境的 API，无需处理基础设施或 MLOps。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ee51ef91986142c",
      "translationZh": "成本效益：利用自动缩容至零的能力，在端点未使用时缩减基础设施规模以降低成本，同时按端点的运行时长付费，确保成本效益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee1dc794003cc4d8",
      "translationZh": "企业级安全：将模型部署在安全的离线端点中，仅可通过直接 VPC 连接访问，并以 SOC2 Type 2 认证为保障，同时提供 BAA 和 GDPR 数据处理协议，以增强数据安全性与合规性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83004e869cd0f1ae",
      "translationZh": "LLM 优化：针对 LLM 进行优化，通过 Paged Attention 实现高吞吐量，并借助 Text Generation Inference 所支持的自定义 transformers 代码和 Flash Attention 实现低延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d3f7d9fa5a25746",
      "translationZh": "全面的任务支持：开箱即用地支持 🤗 Transformers、Sentence-Transformers 和 Diffusers 的任务及模型，并且易于定制，可支持说话人分离等高级任务，或任何机器学习任务和库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b9c60818249a940",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过以下地址开始使用 Inference Endpoints：https://ui.endpoints.huggingface.co/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2a796d08008e28ee",
      "translationZh": "2. 什么是 Text Embeddings Inference？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31f3a90a1c2897b2",
      "translationZh": "Text Embeddings Inference（TEI）是专为部署开源文本嵌入模型并提供推理服务而打造的解决方案。TEI 专注于高性能的嵌入提取，支持最受欢迎的模型。TEI 支持 Massive Text Embedding Benchmark（MTEB）排行榜上排名前 10 的所有模型，包括 FlagEmbedding、Ember、GTE 和 E5。TEI 目前实现了以下性能优化功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19b60bb67a3a6663",
      "translationZh": "无需模型图编译步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d03c78955940bd4",
      "translationZh": "体积小巧的 docker 镜像和快速启动。准备好迎接真正的无服务器体验吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d7f481a1af7e0d4",
      "translationZh": "基于词元的动态批处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab59f0a898787e45",
      "translationZh": "使用 Flash Attention、Candle 和 cuBLASLt 优化用于推理的 transformers 代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b7c8b0beb6a653c",
      "translationZh": "Safetensors 权重加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7af61301f25f5c09",
      "translationZh": "可用于生产环境（通过 Open Telemetry 实现分布式追踪，提供 Prometheus 指标）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "861282a7ac6654c0",
      "translationZh": "这些功能使吞吐量和成本表现达到了行业领先水平。在 Nvidia A10G Inference Endpoint 上针对 BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 进行的基准测试中，序列长度为 512 tokens，批次大小为 32，我们实现了 450+ req/sec 的吞吐量，成本为 0.00156$ / 1M tokens 或 0.00000156$ / 1k tokens。这比 OpenAI Embeddings（$0.0001 / 1K tokens）便宜 64 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "713c766c7bf01ba0",
      "translationZh": "3. 将嵌入模型部署为推理端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4ab12b886237655",
      "translationZh": "首先，你需要使用已登记付款方式的用户或组织账户登录（你可以在此处添加付款方式），然后访问 Inference Endpoints：https://ui.endpoints.huggingface.co",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24a5c720b5dcfda5",
      "translationZh": "然后，点击“New endpoint”。选择仓库、云平台和区域，调整实例与安全设置，然后部署模型；在我们的示例中，部署的是 BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad7e0b7d15dcdbc0",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 会根据模型大小推荐一种实例类型，其容量应足以运行该模型。这里推荐的是 Intel Ice Lake 2 vCPU。要达到我们所运行的基准测试中的性能，请将实例改为 1x Nvidia A10G。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2869af300e5489fa",
      "translationZh": "注意：如果无法选择该实例类型，你需要联系我们并申请实例配额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a57ce8f8c7b6980",
      "translationZh": "随后，你可以点击“Create Endpoint”来部署模型。1-3 分钟后，端点应该就会上线，可以处理请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2a8f31e8b2f7f893",
      "translationZh": "4. 向端点发送请求并创建嵌入",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef7e3ac41c2075dc",
      "translationZh": "端点概览页面提供了推理组件（Inference Widget），可用于手动发送请求。这样，你就可以使用不同的输入快速测试端点，并将其分享给团队成员。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5dd7712129d0356e",
      "translationZh": "注意：TEI 目前不会自动截断输入。你可以在请求中设置 truncate: true 来启用此功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5109b1e884bbf1b0",
      "translationZh": "除了该组件外，概览页面还提供了 cURL、Python 和 Javascript 的代码片段，你可以用它们向模型发送请求。代码片段展示了如何发送单个请求，但 TEI 也支持批量请求，让你能够同时发送多个文档，以提高端点的利用率。下面是一个将截断设置为 true 的批量请求示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03a912fcea500c6b",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 上使用 TEI，可以以极快的速度和极高的成本效益部署最先进的嵌入模型。Inference Endpoints 拥有行业领先的吞吐量，每秒可处理 450+ 个请求，成本低至每 1k tokens $0.00000156，与 OpenAI Embeddings 相比可实现 64x 的成本节省。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "312b7e58f38cd23d",
      "translationZh": "对于利用文本嵌入来实现语义搜索、聊天机器人、推荐等功能的开发者和企业而言，Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 消除了基础设施方面的额外负担，以最低成本提供高吞吐量，简化了从研究到生产的流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d56adfaff91acdc",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如果你有任何问题，欢迎通过 Twitter 或 LinkedIn 联系我。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
